>
  <p>In the competitive world of private label activewear, the quality of your branding is what separates a premium brand from a generic one. While heat transfer and screen printing have their place, nothing conveys <strong>luxury and durability</strong> quite like professional embroidery.</p>

  <div class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-black aspect-video">
    <video controls class="w-full h-full object-cover">
      <source src="/videos/embroidery-customization.mp4" type="video/mp4">
